  "question": {
    "text": "If the equation\n$a_n x^n+a_{n-1} x^{n-1}+\\ldots \\ldots+a_1 x=0, a_1 \\neq 0, n \\geq 2$, has a positive root $x=\\alpha$, then the equation $n a_n x^{n-1}+(n-1) a_{n-1} x^{n-2}+\\ldots . .+a_1=0$ has a positive root, which is",
